      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On one hand the quest 3 having double the performance of the quest 2 sounds nice. Double the performance, you'd never get double the performance between generations on PC, too many hardware release!\n\nBut on the other hand, the quest 2 only has so much computing power, so doubling it isn't that much.\n\nDrawing a 2d image that has been doubled takes 4 times as many pixels\n\nI think the best I can suggest is look up previous feature requests for this.\n\nYou could also make a world and import 20 or so PC avatar models and try and animate them all at once and see how well a quest handles just that",
