  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "i think that its unfair that to quest players have outdaded shaders and i think that they should share the same graphics that pc players get\n\nlike for example, pc players get all kinds of graphics like glossy avatars, good avatar shading, they get to use hues and emissions, particles, more avatar interactions/conatcts and etc.\n\nmeanwhile quest is very limited and rarely get as much access to what vrchat beholds, such as worse/outdated avatar and world shading, not being able to have as many physbones and overall just sucky.\n\ni also think that its a good idea to add better shaders to quest 2 is because for people that dont have a good pc and cant use/afford a link cable, itd be a easier and faster way for questies.",
